  "structuralWarnings": "Keep the :where(.rw-sec) scope wrapper and each band's single .container; .rw-sN have zero rules, so all paint comes from co-classes (et-band--warm/--paper/--seam, surface-dark, et-wash, which needs position:relative plus a z-index:1 container). Never drop position:absolute on inset media and overlays: .et-media-img, .dc-frame__img, .od-media__img, .et-cat__scene, .et-cat__scrim, .ha-hero__scrim, .ct-find__art/pin/tag, and the frosted badges. .od-record__grid and mobile .bw-founder__copy depend on display:contents. Two-column hero grids must stay grid, collapsing to one column. Cards stay flex-column height:100% so .ia-plans and __go links keep margin-top:auto. .dc-pill, .dc-visit__row, .bw-manifesto__value are hairline rows, never cards. Keep .ethc-house bare (no pill bg/border/shadow), .ha-cond one anchor of spans, .bw-toc counters intact, .ha-nap non-glass. Media frames are full-bleed cover: glass reads only on the rim."
